    f "*risos* É, boa sorte."

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:2367
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_c912cc33:

#   mc "There you go, there's that chuckle of maturity that I want."
    mc "Pronto, aí está aquele risinho de maturidade que eu queria."

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:2368
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_5c625c89:

#   mc "See you later, Frey."
    mc "Até logo, Frey."

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:2369
