#   g "Stop simping for my voice, Sky."
    g "Pare de bajular minha voz, Sky."

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3284
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_2081de16:

#   m "... I second Sky's opinion. Seeing Gwen stop Aine and Freya's fight yesterday proves she can handle things when they get out of hand."
    m "...Concordo com a opinião da Sky. Ver a Gwen impedir a briga da Aine e da Freya ontem prova que ela sabe lidar com as coisas quando elas saem do controle."

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3285
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_e70af14e:

#   m "I think she's the one."
    m "Acho que é ela."

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3288
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_ed71439b:

#   mc "You should include yourself too, you know?"
    mc "Você também deveria se incluir, sabia?"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3291
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_86e6e8c8:

#   m "It's true that I was forged in the fires of war, molded to take command, to lead legions into the chaos of battle."
    m "É verdade que fui forjado no fogo da guerra, moldado para assumir o comando, para liderar legiões no caos da batalha."

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3292
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_04d24aa4:

#   m "But each order I gave, every directive I issued, was a whisper in the reaper's ear, beckoning him closer to those under my command."
