# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3293
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_0047585c:

#   m "The weight of their lives, the chorus of their final cries, haunts me to this very day."
    m "O peso de suas vidas, o coro de seus gritos finais, me assombra até hoje."

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3296
translate brazil freyastitchcosplay_c7120f16:

#   m "I refuse to be the puppet master of death any longer, to string along souls to their untimely end."
    m "Recuso-me a continuar sendo o manipulador da morte, a conduzir almas a um fim prematuro."

